ClampSpeed(min=1.0, max=1.3), which means if the speed is modified, its minimum and maximum values are limited, i.e., the character's speed cannot be less than 100% of the default value, nor greater than 130%
At the same time, it takes effect simultaneously with the combat constant table's SPEED_RATE_LOWER_LIMIT, and the stricter of the two is taken. Only one layer is supported; subsequent ones directly overwrite the previous ones
When multiple ClampSpeeds take effect simultaneously, the rules are:
1. When multiple mins exist, the max of them takes effect;
2. When multiple maxs exist, the min of them takes effect;
3. When the final min is greater than the final max, the max takes effect;

